1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,979
Look carefully with your heart

2
00:00:32,979 --> 00:00:35,960
The truth is right around the corner

3
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,980
Hey you good or bad, truth or lies

4
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:41,980
Can't escape the gray haze of the soul

5
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,960
Bring all your courage

6
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,159
Maybe you can save this world

7
00:00:48,159 --> 00:00:50,299
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

8
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:53,700
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

9
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,679
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

10
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:57,900
Mojo Spy

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,760
Amber Golden Monkey

12
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,799
[Information intercepted successfully]

13
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:29,799
[Dorothy: Today's storm will arrive on time at Whitewater Pond --MR.K]

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,900
The Illumin-Eye

15
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,840
What are they up to this time?

16
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,539
Fly, fly

17
00:01:52,539 --> 00:01:54,060
Cute little puppet

18
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:57,640
Welcome to the Illumin-Eye's Theater of Death

19
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,439
The curtain has risen

20
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:03,219
Hurry and take the stage with your friends

21
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,240
Invisibility watch

22
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,960
Just as I thought — the Illumin-Eye

23
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:34,339
No need to hide

24
00:04:34,339 --> 00:04:34,939
It's me

25
00:04:34,939 --> 00:04:38,579
So it's you

26
00:04:38,579 --> 00:04:40,160
Why didn't you say hello earlier?

27
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,519
Made me a little nervous.

28
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:45,379
So even the famous Storm Hunter

29
00:04:45,379 --> 00:04:46,519
can get scared.

30
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:49,800
That flying kid just popped up out of nowhere

31
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,459
and kept chasing me.

32
00:04:51,459 --> 00:04:54,000
Forget that.

33
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,459
I've got a question for you.

34
00:04:55,459 --> 00:04:57,500
This electric gun you gave me

35
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,600
ran out of energy after just a few shots.

36
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,160
And the watch even leaks electricity!

37
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,459
It made me miss my prey for nothing.

38
00:05:03,459 --> 00:05:05,980
Weren't you the one saying

39
00:05:05,980 --> 00:05:07,459
these two pieces of gear were flawless?

40
00:05:07,459 --> 00:05:08,519
So why are they both broken?

41
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:11,660
The reason the Tantalus Gun

42
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:12,959
can only fire a few times

43
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:15,100
is because the power source is incomplete.

44
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:16,300
Incomplete?

45
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:17,720
Idiot.

46
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,939
Think back.

47
00:05:18,939 --> 00:05:21,500
Why did we give you the Tantalus Gun?

48
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:30,800
Back then, I hunted your Illumin-Eye boss's Phoenix machine and got caught by you.

49
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:34,199
Then your boss saw I had both brains and bravery

50
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,800
and one hell of a shot.

51
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:39,139
Then they'd drop the poaching charges.

52
00:05:39,139 --> 00:05:40,879
And even gave me this weird gun.

53
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:42,680
Now I get it.

54
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:45,579
Could this gun be powered by me, the wise and brave?

55
00:05:45,579 --> 00:05:47,040
Then I—

56
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,200
Mr. Storm,

57
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:52,400
Then let me help you remember correctly.

58
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,400
The reason we gave you the gun

59
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,960
is because Lord Illumin-Eye

60
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:59,600
discovered you had a Gemini necklace

61
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:02,280
made of a peculiar material,

62
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:04,300
with a dazzling glow.

63
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:08,600
And the only one who can unleash its sacred power

64
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,439
is the Tantalus Gun.

65
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:12,439
Use these two things well,

66
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:15,340
so that our Illumin-Eye may shine upon the world,

67
00:06:15,340 --> 00:06:18,160
and contribute to a happier, more harmonious world.

68
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:22,000
Mm, contribute, contribute, contribute.

69
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:26,700
It's all my fault for insisting on secretly training your Illumin-Eye's pet,

70
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:29,580
and ending up enslaved by you.

71
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:32,440
But I already used the necklace.

72
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:34,340
Why is the power still insufficient?

73
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:37,820
Your necklace is called Gemini.

74
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:39,540
Could there be only one?

75
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:43,740
Right. The Gemini necklace originally had two.

76
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:45,860
The other one is with my brother.

77
00:06:45,860 --> 00:06:48,199
To fully power this strange gun,

78
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:50,660
I’ll need both necklaces.

79
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:51,819
But many years ago,

80
00:06:51,819 --> 00:06:53,800
my brother and I had a falling-out.

81
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,759
We went our separate ways.

82
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:56,160
We lost all contact.

83
00:06:56,160 --> 00:07:02,199
So

84
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:04,900
finding his necklace won’t be easy.

85
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:08,180
You’re all brawn

86
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:09,620
and no brain.

87
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:12,759
You underestimate The Illumin-Eye.

88
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:16,079
The reason I brought you to this beautiful Whitewater Pool Forest

89
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:20,420
is because your brother is right here.

90
00:07:20,420 --> 00:07:24,480
Now, how you get his necklace

91
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:28,039
is up to you.

92
00:07:28,039 --> 00:07:30,180
Ah... uh.

93
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:34,259
And after I get it?

94
00:07:34,259 --> 00:07:36,060
Simple.

95
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,420
Take them out.

96
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:45,139
Hey, why are there so many kids?

97
00:07:45,139 --> 00:07:46,779
Huh, that black-haired kid...

98
00:07:46,779 --> 00:07:48,920
Isn’t that the guy flying in the sky earlier?

99
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,219
Tell me now,

100
00:07:50,219 --> 00:07:51,860
who are they?

101
00:07:51,860 --> 00:07:53,740
Who are they?

102
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:54,759
They—

103
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:57,060
They're vermin!

104
00:07:57,060 --> 00:07:58,519
A cancer!

105
00:07:58,519 --> 00:08:00,620
A dark cloud that rises, uninvited,

106
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:01,699
into the flawless sky!

107
00:08:01,699 --> 00:08:03,519
Sinners who block the great Illumin-Eye

108
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:06,180
from opening love's gate to all the world!

109
00:08:06,180 --> 00:08:10,079
Though our great doctrine

110
00:08:10,079 --> 00:08:11,399
teaches us to love all,

111
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:14,220
to bring joy to more people,

112
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:18,120
we must, however painful, eliminate this handful.

113
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:20,800
Storm,

114
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,880
for a professional hunter like you,

115
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:25,300
these vermin should be no trouble, right?

116
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:30,320
But they're living, breathing people!

117
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,100
Hunting animals? I'm fine with that.

118
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:34,160
Hunting people? I can't bring myself to do it.

119
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:36,820
You idiot!

120
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:39,480
Hunting innocent animals—now that's shameful.

121
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,899
Wiping out these pests

122
00:08:40,899 --> 00:08:42,639
is only right and proper!

123
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:43,879
Forget it.

124
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:44,980
Good thing from the very start,

125
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,840
I never planned to entrust this all to you.

126
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,420
This idiot

127
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:50,120
This time I'll get rid of them myself

128
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,800
Everything's already planned out

129
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:53,460
All you have to do

130
00:08:53,460 --> 00:08:55,379
Is follow my plan obediently

131
00:08:55,379 --> 00:08:57,920
You want me to be your accomplice

132
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,100
In wiping out kids

133
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,340
That's going too far

134
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:00,980
I won't do it

135
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:03,080
Since you need my necklace

136
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,480
Fine then, I'll just give it to you

137
00:09:07,779 --> 00:09:08,800
We'll meet again

138
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:25,720
Heh heh, forgot to tell you

139
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,420
That invisibility watch on your wrist

140
00:09:27,420 --> 00:09:29,280
Has already been modified by me

141
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:32,380
Anyone who won't cooperate with our Illumin-Eye

142
00:09:32,380 --> 00:09:35,040
I'll treat them just like pests

143
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,060
You hear me?

144
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:38,060
Ending theme

145
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:44,560
So unlike

146
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:48,760
One person, lonely and alone

147
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:52,200
Sometimes life

148
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:56,680
Can't help but be a little unhappy

149
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:59,840
Saying goodbye to classics

150
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:04,180
Always makes one feel lost

151
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:12,020
Look, tomorrow is waving to me from the horizon

152
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:19,620
Every day, from sunrise to sunset, spinning through time, dreaming more

153
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:25,120
Awaiting every second, every moment of life

154
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:31,419
My bright eyes are sparkling

155
00:10:31,419 --> 00:10:34,779
Reflecting a sunlit smile

156
00:10:34,779 --> 00:10:40,019
Breaking through the silent crossroads

157
00:10:40,019 --> 00:10:44,759
Come in, come in.

158
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:47,759
This is Dr. Chunfeng, who does animal research.

159
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:50,799
To figure out this weird mutation,

160
00:10:50,799 --> 00:10:53,360
I went through tons of research material.

161
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,800
This is a twin necklace passed down in my family.

162
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:56,899
Qi Keqiang's attributes

163
00:10:56,899 --> 00:10:59,600
are all exactly the opposite of the mutated golden snub-nosed monkeys.